    "detailed_description": "Repeated exploration and hunting down adventurers in a rogue-like RPG!<br><br>Hunt down numerous adventurers and earn money through running a brothel!<br><br>\u25a0 Story<br><br>A goblin burdened with debt...<br>&quot;Gob, the goblin who hunts adventurers and earns money by running a brothel!&quot;<br>And so, the goblin's adventurer-hunting journey begins.<br><br>\u25a0 System<br><br>\u2605 Use your earned money to gain advantages in exploration<br><br>Collect money and treasures to purchase advantageous items for exploration!<br>Make the exploration easier and easier!<br>There is no game over, so you can challenge as many times as you want!<br><br>\u2605 Throw captured adventurers into the brothel and make money<br><br>By capturing adventurers, you automatically earn money!<br>Capture as many adventurers as possible!<br><br>\u25a0 Features<br><br>No game over!<br>A simple rogue-like game where you repeatedly explore and hunt adventurers!<br><br>\u2605 Simple yet deeply engaging rogue-like with endless possibilities!<br><br>\u2605 Smooth and fast-paced gameplay!<br><br>\u2605 Sensual animations that run smoothly!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499770/extras/49daea981a8294a99ba445796b3cd178.poster.avif?t=1694098368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499770/extras/49daea981a8294a99ba445796b3cd178.webm?t=1694098368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499770/extras/49daea981a8294a99ba445796b3cd178.mp4?t=1694098368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499770/extras/45fa7570ce896050756fa8ea27b9192c.poster.avif?t=1694098368